{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "avg_pool2d",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous, channels_last optional",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "kernel_size",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "stride",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "default": null
        },
        {
          "name": "padding",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "default": null
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, floor((H + 2*padding - kernel_size)/stride + 1), floor((W + 2*padding - kernel_size)/stride + 1)]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.avg_pool(x)，其中 self.avg_pool 为 nn.AvgPool2d(kernel_size, stride=stride, padding=padding)。",
        "实际执行 2D 平均池化，对每个输出位置计算输入窗口内元素的平均值，包含 padding 区域的零值。",
        "输出尺寸计算采用 floor 模式，与 PyTorch AvgPool2d 一致。",
        "输入支持 float32 和 GPU 连续张量；输出为 float32 GPU 张量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "log_softmax_dim1",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous, channels_last optional",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, H, W]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.softmax(x)，其中 self.softmax 为 torch.nn.LogSoftmax(dim=1)。",
        "沿 dim=1（通道维）计算 log softmax：对每个 N 和空间位置，输出 y[n,c,h,w] = x[n,c,h,w] - log(sum_{c'} exp(x[n,c',h,w]))。",
        "数值稳定：实际计算通常先减去每个空间位置上的最大值，再进行 exp 和 log。",
        "输出与输入 shape 相同，dtype 为 float32。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.avg_pool(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 AvgPool2d(kernel_size=3, stride=2, padding=1)，输入 [512,3,256,256] 输出 [512,3,128,128]。",
        "每个输出元素是输入 3x3 窗口（包含零 padding）的平均值。",
        "步长为 2，填充为 1，输出尺寸 floor((256+2-3)/2+1)=128。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.softmax(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 LogSoftmax(dim=1)，在通道维上对每个空间位置独立计算 log softmax。",
        "输入输出 shape 均为 [512,3,128,128]。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回最终的 log softmax 结果，shape 为 [512,3,128,128]。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}